    {
      "bbox": [
        225,
        1658,
        1903,
        2037
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Mayor has given the United Fund his complete endorsement and has appointed me as the Co-Chairman of the Campaign. In the Memorandum, the Mayor has asked the heads of each Administration and Department to appoint a senior member of their executive staff to serve as Campaign Chairman and a representative of their major employee union to serve as Co-Chairman. Please have Chairmen's names in my office by August 12.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
