    {
      "bbox": [
        225,
        2059,
        1936,
        2306
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "I have asked Mr. Stephen Briganti, Division Director of the United Fund, to contact you for an appointment. He will meet with you concerning the campaign and will need only a few minutes of your time to brief you on what is necessary to run an effective campaign.",
